{"id": 996945, "slug": "the-headliners", "name": "The Headliners", "name_original": "The Headliners", "description": "<p>As New York falls under attack by mysterious creatures, <strong>you and your team of 1 to 4 fearless journalists must risk everything to snap spectacular photos and escape to make the headlines</strong> !</p><p>Explore the abandoned &amp; dangerous streets of New York, enter buildings, search every dark alley and hidden corner for anything that could be worth discovering. Danger is around every turn.  </p><p>Each member of your team is armed with a camera. Snap shots of the destruction, the alien invaders, or even your teammates being torn apart by creatures. The choice is yours—capture the chaos however you see fit.</p><p>If you survive the chaos and make it out alive, review your photos and hope they’re headline-worthy. You start with 3 press cards, and each expedition uses one. Only by making the headlines can you earn more and continue your dangerous journey</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-01-30", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-10-04T00:18:01", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f6a/f6af5023643a19cc22e186bc361a0ac1.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/a98/a987b1050342c69a0cd7488fa08d00c9.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 2.44, "rating_top": 3, "ratings": [{"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 5, "percent": 55.56}, {"id": 1, "title": "skip", "count": 3, "percent": 33.33}, {"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 11.11}], "reactions": null, "added": 33, "added_by_status": {"yet": 2, "owned": 14, "beaten": 5, "toplay": 3, "dropped": 9}, "playtime": 4, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0,